{"title":"Fruits","slug":"Fruits","pageid":2621,"revid":22155,"timestamp":"2026-08-22T00:13:23Z","lastEditor":"BaconTheBacon1","categories":["Fruits","Resources"],"infobox":null,"sections":[{"id":"spawning","text":"Spawning"},{"id":"uses","text":"Uses"},{"id":"limited-fruits","text":"Limited Fruits"}],"body":"<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"spawning\">Spawning</h2>\n<p>Fruits spawn on various trees and bushes in Oaklands depended on type of tree, tree and bush location and biome. Fruits can be harvested by grabbing them from the tree or chopping the tree down. Some fruit will die (disappear not long after you cut the tree) if you chop down the tree (unless you are using the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Living_Axe/\">Living Axe</a>), it's better to harvest by hand if you want to get more quantity (if you do not have the Living Axe). Fruits spawn on the leaves of trees or near the top of the tree on the bark.\n</p>\n<h2 id=\"uses\">Uses</h2>\n<p>Fruit can be sold raw but will net a lower profit. It can also be turned into jam by using the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Press_Machine/\">Press Machine</a> to convert the fruit to its respective Jam, by including the fruit as well as an empty <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Jar/\">jar</a>. The Jam can be sold for profit; each type of jam will sell for 4x the base price of the fruit used. Note: Jams give back the empty jar when sold. Additionally, eating fruits gives temporary effects to the player. Consuming jam gives the same effect for significantly more time. (More research needed for effect durations)\n</p>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>Fruits\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Fruit Names\n</th>\n<th>Fruit Images\n</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"currency\">Fruit Value\n</th>\n<th>Jam Value\n</th>\n<th>Jam Names\n</th>\n<th>Jam Images\n</th>\n<th>Where to Find:\n</th>\n<th>Approximate money earning speed (not counting travel time)\n</th>\n<th>Consumption Effect\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Apple/\">Apple</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: AppleFruit\">AppleFruit</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$100\n</td>\n<td>400$\n</td>\n<td>Apple Jam\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Apple Jam\">Apple Jam</span></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Oak/\">Oak</a>\n</td>\n<td>1200 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Small health boost\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th><span title=\"Acorn (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWNvcm4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Acorn</span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>$80\n</th>\n<th>$320\n</th>\n<th>Acorn Jam\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Oak/\">Oak</a>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Small health boost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pear/\">Pear</a>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pear\">Pear</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$120\n</td>\n<td>$480\n</td>\n<td>Pear Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pear Jam\">Pear Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Birch/\">Birch</a>\n</td>\n<td>4760 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Small health boost\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Orange/\">Orange</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Orange\">Orange</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$150\n</td>\n<td>$600\n</td>\n<td>Orange Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Orange Jam\">Orange Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Acacia/\">Acacia</a> (Finlay Island)\n</td>\n<td>3000 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Slightly increased chopping power\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lemon/\">Lemon</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lemon\">Lemon</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$150\n</td>\n<td>$600\n</td>\n<td>Lemon Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Lemon Jam\">Lemon Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Acacia/\">Acacia</a> (Ferwater Island)\n</td>\n<td>3000 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Speed boost, equivalent to while using <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Speed_Coil/\">Speed Coil</a> or <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fusion_Coil/\">Fusion Coil</a>\n<p>Effect does not stack with coils\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Dragonfruit/\">Dragonfruit</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Dragonfruit\">Dragonfruit</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$200\n</td>\n<td>$800\n</td>\n<td>Dragonfruit Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Dragonfruit Jam\">Dragonfruit Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Acacia/\">Acacia</a> (Inside the Desert)\n</td>\n<td>3000 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Slightly increased mining power\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Coconut/\">Coconut</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Coconut\">Coconut</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$100\n</td>\n<td>$400\n</td>\n<td>Coconut Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Coconut Jam\">Coconut Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Palm/\">Palm</a>\n</td>\n<td>1200 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Ability to climb trees, cannot be consumed raw\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Banana/\">Banana</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: BananaFruit\">BananaFruit</span></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>$50\n</td>\n<td>$200\n</td>\n<td>Banana Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Banana Jam\">Banana Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/King_Palm/\">King Palm</a>\n</td>\n<td>2500 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Jump boost, reaching the same height as when using <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Gravity_Coil/\">Gravity Coil</a> or <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Fusion_Coil/\">Fusion Coil</a>\n<p>Effect does not stack with coils\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Grapes/\">Grapes</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Grapes\">Grapes</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$100\n</td>\n<td>$400\n</td>\n<td>Grape Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Grape Jam\">Grape Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Bushes in the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Lighthouse/\">Lighthouse</a> area\n</td>\n<td>800 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Reduced move speed\n<p>Possibly other effects\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Blueberries/\">Blueberries</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Blueberries\">Blueberries</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$100\n</td>\n<td>$400\n</td>\n<td>Blueberry Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Blueberry Jam\">Blueberry Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Bushes in the spawn area\n</td>\n<td>800 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Restores oxygen\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Cranberries/\">Cranberries</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Cranberries\">Cranberries</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>$100\n</td>\n<td>$400\n</td>\n<td>Cranberry Jam\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Cranberry Jam\">Cranberry Jam</span></span>\n</td>\n<td>Bushes in the Forest area\n</td>\n<td>800 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Brief fire resistance\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Kiwi/\">Kiwi</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: KiwiFruit\">KiwiFruit</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$180\n</td>\n<td>$720\n</td>\n<td>Kiwi Jam\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: KiwiJam\">KiwiJam</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>Bushes on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>\n</td>\n<td>1440 per minute\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Olive\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>$100\n</td>\n<td>$400\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Olive/\">Olivewood</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Removes all effects\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Golden_Apple/\">Golden Apple</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Golden Apple\">Golden Apple</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$2500\n</td>\n<td>$10,000\n</td>\n<td>Golden Apple Jam\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Golden Apple Jem\">Golden Apple Jem</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>1/1000 chance to spawn in place of a normal apple\n</td>\n<td>0 per minute\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pomegranate/\">Pomegranate</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pomegranate image\">Pomegranate image</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>$240\n</td>\n<td>$960\n</td>\n<td>Pomegranate Jam\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Pomegranate Jam image\">Pomegranate Jam image</span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>bushes on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Snowy_Peaks/\">Snow Island</a>\n</td>\n<td>500 per minute\n</td>\n<td>Fire resistance\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wurian\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Wurian\">Wurian</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Wurian\">Wurian</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/River_Caves/\">River Caves</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Major healing, 28 seconds\n<p>Cannot be consumed raw\n</p><p>Fruit is explosive, handle with care (1/3 max health in damage)\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Root_Froot/\">Root Froot</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Root froot\">Root froot</span> \t<noscript><span class=\"ok-media-placeholder\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Root froot\">Root froot</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>$180\n</td>\n<td>$720\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Ceiling of <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/River_Caves/\">River Caves</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Raw - Levitation, 7 seconds\n<p>In Jar - Air Swimming, 40 seconds\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Watermelon\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>in patches on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Ferwater/\">Ferwater Island</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chestnut\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Reduced damage and knockback taken\n<p>(20 seconds raw, 2 minutes jarred)\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"limited-fruits\">Limited Fruits</h2>\n<div class=\"ok-tablewrap\"><table>\n<caption>Limited Fruits\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Fruit Names\n</th>\n<th>Fruit Images\n</th>\n<th>Fruit Value\n</th>\n<th>Jam Value\n</th>\n<th>Jam Names\n</th>\n<th>Jam Images\n</th>\n<th>Where to Find:\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Pumpkin/\">Pumpkin</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>60 candy\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Pumpkin Spots on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay Island</a> (Halloween Events only)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Green_Pumpkin/\">Green Pumpkin</a>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>Pumpkin Spots on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Finlay/\">Finlay Island</a> (Halloween Events only)\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n\n</div>"}
